WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.778
Today we will communicate ideas through body movement. Our work connects with

00:00:04.778 --> 00:00:06.685
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:10.776
Choose a character and identify one important action.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:16.690
Try three gestures that communicate the action without words. Record why your chosen

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.251
technique suits the message.

00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:22.551
Show your gesture sequence while a friend identifies the story.
